      "text": [
        " «إِذاً يَكُونَ عَلَيْهِ فِدَاءٌ آخَرُ» قِيلَ فَأَيَّ شَيْءٍ يَصْنَعُ بِهِ قَالَ «يَدْفِنُهُ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2733 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about a person in the state of ihram who hunts game and pays its expiation: Should they eat it or discard it?\nImam (as) said: \"If they eat it, then another expiation becomes obligatory upon them.\"\nThey asked: \"What should they do with it then?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"They should bury it.\""
        ]
      }
